        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "The panels were formerly in the collection of Miss Matilda Marks who bought them from Redfords of Mount Street. A former partner in the firm had bought them from the Russian agency, Argos, in Paris before the war; they were then said to have come from the Hermitage."@en ;
